dealing with a U.T.I.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.530
you guys are, like,
so, so down to earth.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.966
- No, don't misunderstand,
bitch.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.769
